00:18:38,561 --> 00:18:40,880
And that's what we try to portray on the battlefield.

271
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:49,740
Colonel Davis and the 11th Cav know they all have to be at their best to bring out the best in the incoming rotation from Fort Hood.

