00:28:02,981 --> 00:28:14,624
Here, before any wargaming scenarios can begin, all soldiers, weapons and vehicles must first be outfitted with the most important component of the NTC's force on

388
00:28:14,625 --> 00:28:17,140
force capability, the Miles system.

389
00:28:17,141 --> 00:28:24,240
Each individual soldier is issued what's called a halo, goes on his helmet,

390
00:28:24,241 --> 00:28:30,120
and then he also has a harness that goes over his body that has the sensors on that

391
00:28:30,121 --> 00:28:35,620
so that when the laser is fired at that individual soldier, it will give off a tone

