00:28:35,621 --> 00:28:42,900
and let the soldier know whether or not he's been shot, hit, killed, or whether it's been a near miss.

393
00:28:42,901 --> 00:28:48,740
On the battlefield, a soldier will hear an extended beep from his miles unit

394
00:28:48,741 --> 00:28:52,360
and a card carried in it will instruct him as to the extent of his injury.

395
00:28:53,660 --> 00:28:55,580
He will then have to assume a role as wounded

396
00:28:55,581 --> 00:28:59,200
