399
00:29:09,621 --> 00:29:20,055
With all personal weapons the soldier may want to utilize, he has to make sure that his laser engagement system, the MILES transmitter, is zeroed to the appropriate

400
00:29:20,056 --> 00:29:23,300
meters required as if he were firing actual rounds.

