00:29:26,280 --> 00:29:31,700
This drill also applies to tanks and all other fighting vehicles which are rigged with MILES sensor belts.

402
00:29:31,701 --> 00:29:38,880
the vehicle commanders and gunners have to boresight all their weapon systems to be effective when they shoot their laser

403
00:29:38,881 --> 00:29:42,320
exactly the same as if they were using actual live rounds

