00:29:46,801 --> 00:29:49,280
which is normally utilized for live fire

406
00:29:49,281 --> 00:29:53,320
and boresight their cross layers inside the vehicle on the target

407
00:29:53,321 --> 00:29:56,000
if they don't accurately do those procedures

