The Prime Minister of Mojave has asked for American assistance.

429
00:31:53,380 --> 00:31:58,480
So what we try and replicate is everything you would see in a major regional contingency

430
00:31:58,481 --> 00:32:01,100
where we had to deploy heavy armored forces.

431
00:32:02,760 --> 00:32:06,421
Once again, the game plan takes into account everything that U.S.

432
00:32:06,422 --> 00:32:07,660
forces might encounter

