00:33:55,201 --> 00:34:06,540
During Kosovo and during Bosnia, we were able to build teams that consisted of soldiers from a variety of nations.

452
00:34:07,060 --> 00:34:14,160
The Russians, particularly, when we linked with them in Bosnia, were very complimentary of the professionalism of our force.

